sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Your code
  participant A as Claude API
  participant M as Model
  participant T as Your tool
  C->>A: messages + tools (JSON Schemas)
  A->>M: tool system prompt + definitions + messages
  Note over M: next-token prediction<br/>(strict: grammar masks tokens)
  M-->>A: tokens for get_weather with city Paris
  A-->>C: tool_use block, stop_reason tool_use
  C->>T: run get_weather(city="Paris")
  T-->>C: "15 C, partly cloudy"
  C->>A: same history + assistant turn + tool_result
  A->>M: whole conversation again
  M-->>A: final answer tokens
  A-->>C: text block, stop_reason end_turn
